From 14f94f992503217cdbefc8c6c8d0fffd0a82e618 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:44:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] T71 F8: the entity model learns poly and image, the
 renderers read them

primitives: entPoly (a closed or open run of points, filled or not); moveEntities and
boundsOf handle poly and image. svg: poly as a path, image, text with right alignment,
a white mask, bold and a colour. dxf: poly as a POLYLINE, an image as its frame,
right-aligned text. drawingExport: drawSheet fills rects and polys, adds an image,
masks and aligns text. layers: SHEET_MUTED, SHEET_CUT, APPLIANCE added, nothing edited.
views: one guard, legSymbol 'none' skips the grammar's three-line leg so the set can
draw the scene's. profile: drawings.set, the sheet law's numbers, with its migration.
No cut number moves; the six goldens are byte-identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UMSCbqdi85whfyRQS2gqQ2
